<title>GERMANY: Nuernberger to sell De Amersfoortse stake.</title>
<headline>Nuernberger to sell De Amersfoortse stake.</headline>
<dateline>NUREMBURG, Germany 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>German insurance group Nuernberger Beteiligungs AG said on Tuesday it planned to sell a 20 percent stake in Dutch insurer De Amersfoortse Verzekrings Groupe N.V. to the insurance group Stad Rotterdam.</p>
<p>The company said in a mandatory statement that the sale would &quot;probably&quot; go ahead in June.</p>
<p>De Amersfoortse was currently valued at around 800 million marks ($463.1 million), Nuernberger said.</p>
<p>The German company said its co-operation agreement with De Amerfoortse would be extended to Stad Rotterdam.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525 ($ = 1.727 German Marks)</p>
</text>
